###### High School GCSE Tracking and Results Dashboard

**Summary of Project:**

Annual tracking and reviewing of GCSE results in school in the UK has often utilised spreadsheets for review. Analysis tools for results are often exam board specific. Utilising a series of dashboards in Power BI, I created a model to present a whole school executive overview, subject performance with optional filtering by key indicators of gender, SEND, EAL and Pupil Premium, subject comparison and individual student performance for tailored reporting. 
